ready: 1
kind: quality
id: retention.quality.schedule
display_id: QC-RETENTION-SCHEDULE
module: retention
title: Retention happens on schedule
applies_to:
  - retention.seq.sweep
measure: Delay between a record becoming due for a status change or deletion and that change
target: At most one day while the daemon runs; at the next daemon start otherwise, because a missed sweep runs at start
